==Miscellaneous==
*Added 3 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**6,600 grants 5 Catamin [A].
**6,700 grants 5 Catamin [B].
**6,800 grants 5 Catamin [C].
*Increased [[Gamatoto Expedition|Gamatoto]] level cap to 94.
*The player is now able to see previous User Rank rewards.
*Growing [[Catfruit|Catfruit Seeds]] into Catfruit now requires 5 Seeds instead of 10.
*The storage system now shows how many and max [[Cat Units]] and [[Catfruit]] are in storage.

